      "target": {
       "name": "Monte Grande hollow drill site",
       "why": "Hollow between ridges where Curiosity drilled the 'Nevado Sajama' rock to compare it with the ridges: why did the ridges survive and the hollow did not? Look at the floor covered by sand and pebbles, which made finding bare rock to drill hard.",
